^{:go/end 38} (go/func NewTypeParam "NewTypeParam returns a new TypeParam. Type parameters may be set on a Named\ntype by calling SetTypeParams. Setting a type parameter on more than one type\nwill result in a panic.\n\nThe constraint argument can be nil, and set later via SetConstraint. If the\nconstraint is non-nil, it must be fully defined.\n" ^{:tag (* TypeParam)} [^{:tag (* TypeName)} obj ^Type constraint]
