^{:go/end 156} (go/method is "is calls f with the specific type terms of t's constraint and reports whether\nall calls to f returned true. If there are no specific terms, is\nreturns the result of f(nil).\n" ^bool [^{:tag (* TypeParam)} t ^{:tag (func [(* term)] [bool])} f]
